##### ThreadSanitizer check, issue94
date_utc: 2026-09-28T00:21:31Z  host: small-refmac-machine  source_sha: c699a52db4a6465403e48f3c888327dd5b4aa839
lane: taskset -c 32-47 under flock /tmp/motioncorr-issue96-cpu-validation.lock

Rationale: OMP_NUM_THREADS=1 throughout. GCC's libgomp is not TSan-annotated,
so OpenMP worker threads produce false positives that would bury a real finding.
With one OpenMP thread the ONLY concurrency left is exactly what this PR adds:
the producer thread running alongside the consumer.

